e AI opponent.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lv.1</strong> plays simply and attacks directly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lv.3</strong> chains spells and plans for long-term advantage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lv.5</strong> considers every card, creature, and order of play. Expect to be outmaneuvered.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Carl Treadway"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878390/79632207650a928ea3bbbed19ebe25588b505e8e/header.jpg?t=1767980412","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Carl Treadway & Freedom Games - All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 - 13.10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.1 compatible graphics card, integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 (Big Sur) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any Intel or Apple Silicon processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4 GB  RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2878390/580698564/cbd4ae61814f2df86fb2b7842dffde82e5bd70c6/1767843534/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767977842","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2878390/580698564/cbd4ae61814f2df86fb2b7842dffde82e5bd70c6/1767843534/dash_h264.mpd?t=1