7980412","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878390/ss_da069741c0c8c9ac80ce870940fb95d568913067.600x338.jpg?t=1767980412"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878390/ss_30b54ada521277bb9aef482790840a20fd0fdddd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767980412","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878390/ss_30b54ada521277bb9aef482790840a20fd0fdddd.600x338.jpg?t=1767980412"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878390/ss_d2e11d5951277fd41386414a5303c57965a09d5e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767980412","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878390/ss_d2e11d5951277fd41386414a5303c57965a09d5e.600x338.jpg?t=1767980412"},{"id":10,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878390/ss_81b34d0c4afaf793683cd3f9868fab5abac14175.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767980412","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878390/ss_81b34d0c4afaf793683cd3f9868fab5abac14175.600x338.jpg?t=1767980412"}],"short_description":"Defeat the Conjurers. Take their constellations. Conquer the Zodiac. A classic turn-based tactics game where deckbuilding lets players summon Zodiac creatures and hybrids, then steal new constellations by defeating rival Conjurers. Will you become powerful enough to face the Immortal Aquarius?","steam_appid":2878390,"support_info":{"email":"support@indie.io","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, German, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":"https://conjurers.us"}